{"id":168,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"マルチクラブで好きが広がる薫英","feature_description":"大阪薫英女学院中学校・高等学校は、「KUN＋EI教育」とマルチクラブを掲げ、運動部と文化部を掛け持ちしながら好きな活動を広げられる学校です。クラブ紹介でも、中高それぞれの活動が具体的に示され、文武両道と人間的成長を両立しやすい構成です。 中学と高校それぞれの活動が公開され、掛け持ちしやすい仕組みも学校の魅力です。 自分の「好き」を広げながら、仲間と切磋琢磨できる環境です。 初心者からでも始めやすい案内が多く、入り口が広い学校です。","clubs":[{"id":2991,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2992,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2993,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2994,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2995,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2996,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2997,"name":"バトントワリング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2998,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":2999,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3000,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3001,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3002,"name":"フットサル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3003,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3004,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kun-ei.jp/jh/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"}